{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Fat Goblins Demo</strong>, where chaos, chubbiness, and class based combat come together in the form of 16v16 giant castle battles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fat Goblins Demo is a chance to participate in regular multiplayer weekends! When the multiplayer weekends aren't active, you'll be able to continue trying out the game in the practice tool where you can try out the different hats and fight against bots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for goblin-packed, hat-stealing, and princess-fattening team based combat with up to 32 friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379850/extras/fat_goblins_mountain-horizontal-fly-over-1_cropped.mp4.gif?t=1759173491\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don different hats to launch fireballs, heal teammates, shoot arrows, or just slice your way through the enemy team!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379850/extras/fat_goblins_ice-mage-combat-2_cropped.mp4.gif?t=1759173491\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breach the walls and rescue your pudgy princess from the clutches of the enemy castle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379850/extras/fat_goblins_break-down-doors_cropped.mp4.gif?t=1759173491\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fatten up your captive royal with delicious meat you scavenge from your teammates &amp; enemies corpses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379850/extras/fat_goblins_ambush-throw-1_cropped.mp4.gif?t=1759173491\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win games to upgrade your runes and create the best hat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379850/extras/fat_goblins_runes_cropped.mp4.gif?t=1759173491\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine abilities with teammates to create powerful combinations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379850/extras/fat_goblins_priest-fire-ult_cropped.mp4.gif?t=1759173491\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3379850?t=1759173491","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3379850?t=1759173491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379850/bbb39268fc3b2aeced1d246d931dbb2d08924fa2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759173491","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379850/bbb39268fc3b2aeced1d246d931dbb2d08924fa2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759173491","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game is cartoony and fun in style, but it contains a lot of (goblin) blood! Whenever a goblin takes damage, their cartoony blood stains the ground for a period of time before fading. There is a setting that allows you to change the color of the goblin blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Fat Goblins Demo</strong>, where chaos, chubbiness, and class based combat come together in the form of 16v16 giant castle battles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fat Goblins Demo is a chance to participate in regular multiplayer weekends! When the multiplayer weekends aren't active, you'll be able to continue trying out the game in the practice tool where you can try out the different hats and fight against bots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for goblin-packed, hat-stealing, and princess-fattening team based combat with up to 32 friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379850/extras/fat_goblins_mountain-horizontal-fly-over-1_cropped.mp4.gif?t=1759173491\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don different hats to launch fireballs, heal teammates, shoot arrows, or just slice your way through the enemy team!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379850/extras/fat_goblins_ice-mage-combat-2_cropped.mp4.gif?t=1759173491\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breach the walls and